     A*
     A*  WFPNP - OUTPUT FILE - PREMIUM NOTICE
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  DESCRIPTION:                                                 *
     A*        THIS FILE WILL HOLD ALL THE FIELDS ASSOCIATED WITH THE *
     A*        PREMIUM NOTICES SCREEN (AND OTHER RELATED FIELDS TO    *
     A*        PREMIUM NOTICES SCREEN). THIS WILL INCLUDE BILLING     *
     A*        PLAN AND BILLING SCHEDULE DESCRIPTION. A FIELD REPRES- *
     A*        SENTING THE DIRECT DEBIT EMPLOYER UTILIZING ACH PROCES *
     A*        SING IS INCLUDED AS WELL.
     A*
     A*  PROGRAMMER  : C:190                                          *
     A*  CREATED     : 10/01/08    PROJECT: 132WLB                    *
     A*****************************************************************
